flowchart LR
  M[Foreign machine/AI] --> E[Signed observation/outcome]
  E --> F[Policy + source-integrity filter]
  F --> C[Learning Candidate]
  C --> D{PWM decision}
  D -->|Accept| P[PLOG derivation / PWM update]
  D -->|Reject| R[Rejected evidence record]
  D -->|Defer| Q[Review queue]
  D -->|Branch| B[Alternative branch]
